# Database

- Single schema module: `src/lib/db/schema.ts`
- Client: Neon HTTP via `src/lib/db/index.ts`
- Prefer text PKs; keep Better Auth table/column names adapter-compatible
- Use `pnpm db:generate` after schema changes; commit SQL under `drizzle/`
- Load skills/drizzle when adding tables, indexes, or query helpers
